  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal, by reasons of the intensification of the site and the number of people proposed to be on site and the lack of layout details provided, would result in an unreasonable degree of impacts with regard to noise and disturbance to the neighbouring occupiers and has not demonstrated that the proposal would result in a satisfactory level of amenity for the future occupiers, contrary to Policies D3, D13, D14 and S3B of The London Plan (2021) and GR1, and SI1B of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;Insufficient information has been provided to demonstrate that the proposed change of use from a public house to a nursery would mitigate the adverse cumulative traffic congestion impacts and preserve the safe and free flow of the public highway network, contrary to policy T4 of the London Plan (2021) and M2 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal, by reasons that the proposed use has not been demonstrated to serve an area of identified need for childcare facilities and no marketing evidence has been provided to justify there is no realistic prospect of the building being used as a public house or such use would not be viable in the foreseeable future, has not been demonstrated that the proposed change of use from a public house to a nursery would be acceptable and would result in an intensification of the use of the site, contrary to policies S1C, S3B and HC7B of the London Plan (2021) and LE2D and SI1 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
